      <tr><td class="hd" data-l="Key">SSH (signing)</td><td data-l="Fingerprint"><span class="dim">Not used. Commits and documents are signed with the OpenPGP key above.</span></td></tr>
      <tr><td class="hd" data-l="Key">Commits</td><td data-l="Fingerprint">Every commit in the site repository is signed. An unsigned commit in that repository is not from me.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
